Helps skin self-renew, replenish nutrients, resist wrinkles and regain smoothness and elasticity. Instantly boosts tension, hydrates, brightens and helps lift slackness.</p>\n<p>Key benefits</p>\n<p>\u2013 Targets tired, aged-looking skin</p>\n<p>\u2013 Supports collagen synthesis, antioxidant and brightening</p>\n<p>\u2013 Helps reduce slackness and reshape a youthful contour</p>","price_hkd":620,"stock":20,"image_paths":["/images/products/prod-9@2x.jpg"],"sort":221}]$json$::jsonb) as x(
  brand_slug text, slug text, title_zh_hk text, title_zh_cn text, title_en text,
